# How do I list compute results from the shell?
# List the submitted compute results as a table with outcome and host, optionally filtered to one batch by external reference.
#
# GENERATED from doc/recipes/shell/compute/how_do_i_list_compute_results_from_the_shell.org — do not edit by hand.
